    a light polyline and on a 2D POLYLINE of straight and arc segments alike; Add Vertex and Remove Vertex on a
    spline's points too.

    The edits of the grips of a 2D POLYLINE of straight and arc segments (DxfPolyline2d of type
    DxfPoly2dType.SimplePoly), the same as a light polyline's: stretch a vertex or a segment, add a vertex,
    remove one, make a segment an arc or a line. A curve-fit or spline-fit one has a grip on each vertex of its
    frame, which CadGrips.DragPolyline2d moves and fits again, and no menu.

