        of board GeomToleranceFull with a zone 5 high and the identifier D are
        {\\Fgdt;j}%%v{\\Fgdt;n}0.1{\\Fgdt;m}%%vA%%vB%%vC, {\\Fgdt;c}%%v0.05, 5{\\Fgdt;p} and D."""

